Name: libprocinfo
URL: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/system/libprocinfo
Version: android-17.0.0_r1
Revision: b58259e79c58deb1132e11d74ea90a2dc441d84f
Update Mechanism: Manual
License: Apache-2.0
License File: //third_party/libunwindstack/LICENSE
Shipped: yes
Security Critical: yes

Description:
Helpers from AOSP to read process information from /proc. libunwindstack
uses include/procinfo/process_map.h, which //third_party/libunwindstack
builds into its libunwindstack target.

src/ holds that file from the upstream repository root, unchanged.

Update instructions:
Update commit hashes in crowbar.txtpb, then run from this directory:
crowbar build --no-dry-run ./

copy.bara.sky lists every file it imports. If the new upstream version
adds a file Chromium needs, add it there and to
//third_party/libunwindstack/BUILD.gn.
